OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen causes disruption in
OL,4,ASouth East
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Austen has brought strong winds
OL,7,Fand heavy rain to south east England,
OL,8,Fcausing widespread travel disruption.
OL,10,FRoads, railways, ferries and flights
OL,11,Fhave been impacted across Kent, Surrey
OL,12,Fand Sussex as the first named storm
OL,13,Fthis winter moves through the country.
OL,15,FEast Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,Fsaid it was called to a Newhaven petrol
OL,17,Fstation to ensure a side of its roof
OL,18,Fthat had come loose did not fall onto a
OL,19,Fpublic highway.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
