OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen causes disruption in
OL,4,ASouth East
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters said they were also called
OL,7,Fto a different petrol station in
OL,8,FPeacehaven, following reports a
OL,9,Fforecourt sign was "hanging
OL,10,Fdangerously" above a road.
